1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Eighteenth Episode
The Magic Mirror

15
00:01:53,421 --> 00:01:55,412
Fantastic!

16
00:01:59,621 --> 00:02:01,498
The best soup in the world!

17
00:02:01,541 --> 00:02:05,500
It has such a delicious scent
that it makes your mouth water!

18
00:02:30,021 --> 00:02:31,500
Come in!

19
00:02:41,661 --> 00:02:43,492
Good morning, Princess Bella!

20
00:02:43,541 --> 00:02:46,009
I have prepared an excellent soup for you.
I recommend you eat it.

21
00:02:46,061 --> 00:02:48,700
I don't want to eat. You know that
I eat one grain of rice a day.

22
00:02:48,741 --> 00:02:51,175
But how can you sustain yourself
on a grain of rice?!

23
00:02:51,901 --> 00:02:53,619
I told you
that I don't want to eat

24
00:02:53,661 --> 00:02:55,538
I must be careful
not to ruin my figure.

25
00:02:55,581 --> 00:02:57,333
Do you want to make me fat?

26
00:02:57,381 --> 00:02:59,611
No, no... I am so sorry, Your Highness

27
00:03:15,421 --> 00:03:18,299
My dear magic mirror,
please, tell me:

28
00:03:18,341 --> 00:03:20,411
who is the most beautiful in all creation?

29
00:03:20,501 --> 00:03:23,698
Listen, my dear Bella.
If you want to know, I will tell you.

30
00:03:24,021 --> 00:03:26,012
Of the universe, of course, I do not know,

31
00:03:26,061 --> 00:03:28,211
but of this country
you are the star.

32
00:03:28,261 --> 00:03:30,536
Therefore, gentle and royal Highness,

33
00:03:30,661 --> 00:03:33,653
consider yourself satisfied
with your beauty.

34
00:03:37,261 --> 00:03:41,015
Magnificent! I am sure that a woman
more beautiful than me cannot exist!

35
00:03:41,061 --> 00:03:44,451
I want to make sure of it by traveling through
all the regions of the world.

36
00:03:51,021 --> 00:03:53,171
There it is! I'm almost right over it!

37
00:03:53,461 --> 00:03:56,612
Got it!
It's really a nice little hare!

38
00:04:00,701 --> 00:04:04,330
Go! I saw it! There
it is! Now I'll catch it!

39
00:04:07,741 --> 00:04:10,414
And with this one, that
makes 11 hares! Not bad, eh?

40
00:04:12,501 --> 00:04:14,378
Come on, Opal!

41
00:04:15,741 --> 00:04:17,572
In mid-air! Like that!

42
00:04:19,381 --> 00:04:21,417
With these, I've caught 12!

43
00:04:21,461 --> 00:04:23,258
What bad luck!

44
00:04:24,341 --> 00:04:26,457
I've found more! Magnificent!

45
00:04:26,901 --> 00:04:28,812
Three in one go!

46
00:04:41,421 --> 00:04:43,298
Did you get hurt?

47
00:04:43,821 --> 00:04:45,812
Actually, I was better
off before, Your Highness.

48
00:04:47,501 --> 00:04:50,459
See, Grand Duke? Did you
think I would end up defeated?

49
00:04:50,501 --> 00:04:53,413
When it comes to skill
and dexterity, I'm no sissy!

50
00:04:53,461 --> 00:04:56,692
What do you say? Actually, I proposed it to you
because it's a very manly game.

51
00:04:56,741 --> 00:04:59,813
So, if I won, it means
that I'm very manly, right?

52
00:04:59,861 --> 00:05:03,615
- Answer! - So it would seem,
by all accounts.

53
00:05:07,021 --> 00:05:10,491
If he still isn't convinced, I'll have to
give him another demonstration.

54
00:05:10,541 --> 00:05:12,213
But what kind?

55
00:05:18,261 --> 00:05:21,492
Fantastic!
How big this carriage is!

56
00:05:21,541 --> 00:05:24,453
It even has an upper level
and looks very luxurious!

57
00:05:26,581 --> 00:05:29,778
Gorgeous!
Look, there are stairs too!

58
00:05:29,821 --> 00:05:32,460
Incredible! It's divided
into rooms, like a house!

59
00:05:32,501 --> 00:05:35,095
Nothing is missing!
There's even a kitchen!

60
00:05:39,301 --> 00:05:42,577
I wonder who the lucky person is who lives
in a carriage like this...!

61
00:05:43,021 --> 00:05:44,818
I want to take a look

62
00:05:46,621 --> 00:05:48,339
There's no one here...

63
00:05:50,541 --> 00:05:54,011
Incredible!
A real bedroom!

64
00:05:58,101 --> 00:06:00,012
There's also a mirror.

65
00:06:05,101 --> 00:06:08,093
What?! What a strange mirror.

66
00:06:08,501 --> 00:06:11,174
I wonder why it doesn't reflect
one's figure properly...!

67
00:06:11,421 --> 00:06:13,412
I'd like to look at myself in it.

68
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:16,412
Now it has become normal.

69
00:06:16,820 --> 00:06:19,813
Make essences
with the flowers you have gathered.

70
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:22,018
As you wish.

71
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:35,251
- There's someone!
- There's someone!

72
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:37,974
- Thief!
- No, wait! I'm not a thief!

73
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,818
Then who are you?

74
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:42,739
- I'm sorry to have frightened you, but I...
- What is it, Your Highness?

75
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:45,131
Don't worry, I'll take care of it.

76
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:47,570
- Oh, no!
- You'll have to deal with me!

77
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:50,852
- Just let me catch you and...
- There's a misunderstanding! Wait!

78
00:06:50,900 --> 00:06:52,698
He managed to escape!

79
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:04,013
That scoundrel got you
dirty, but now I'll clean you up.

80
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:07,420
Listen, my dear mirror,
my magic mirror!

81
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:09,816
Please, tell me:
who is the most beautiful in creation?

82
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:13,017
My dear Beauty,
if you wish, I will tell you.

83
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:15,814
Of the world I do not know, but of this
place you are no longer the star.

84
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:18,011
Accept my invitation:
resign yourself to fate,

85
00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:20,450
for nearby
is one more beautiful than you.

86
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:23,379
Do you mean that in this country
there is one more beautiful than me?!

87
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:25,776
My Princess, it is true.
What I assert this morning...

88
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:28,051
...you will see of the realm
in the next castle.

89
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:31,889
Now you will be informed of a beauty that
is enclosed upon all this earth.

90
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:34,012
Sapphire she is named.

91
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:40,458
I feel like dying at the thought
of no longer being the most beautiful!

92
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:05,217
My little Sapphire

93
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:08,017
What are you doing, my daughter?

94
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:17,176
Good! Better that indiscreet
ears do not hear...

95
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:19,735
- that I call you like a little girl.
- Yes, mother.

96
00:08:32,020 --> 00:08:34,012
Oh, what tenderness!

97
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:37,015
How I wish you could grow up
as a girl,

98
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:39,495
without being forced
to hide your identity

99
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,577
..because of our laws!

100
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:44,340
Our laws are the most precious
possession we have.

101
00:08:44,381 --> 00:08:46,941
If we do not observe them,
the people will not forgive us

102
00:08:46,981 --> 00:08:49,336
Oh, my little Sapphire!

103
00:08:59,581 --> 00:09:02,414
- What do you desire?
- I am looking for a certain Sapphire.

104
00:09:02,461 --> 00:09:04,691
- Do you know who she is?
- Yes, Sapphire is the King's daughter.

105
00:09:04,741 --> 00:09:06,652
She lives in the nearby castle

106
00:09:06,701 --> 00:09:08,817
So it is true
that there is this girl!

107
00:09:08,861 --> 00:09:11,421
- Let's run to the castle!
- Right away, Princess!

108
00:09:11,781 --> 00:09:14,579
No! No, I was wrong!
Sapphire is a boy!

109
00:09:14,621 --> 00:09:17,738
He's a strong and brave
boy! He is not a girl!

110
00:09:18,101 --> 00:09:21,013
What?! Are you sure
that Sapphire is a girl?

111
00:09:21,061 --> 00:09:24,098
Yes, I am sure of it! My
magic mirror never lies...

112
00:09:24,141 --> 00:09:27,451
...and it claims exactly that. It also
said that she is more beautiful than me.

113
00:09:27,501 --> 00:09:29,776
Do you mean you have
a magic mirror?!

114
00:09:29,821 --> 00:09:31,891
But then it is truly a stroke of luck!

115
00:09:31,941 --> 00:09:34,409
It is good fortune that
sends you here to us!

116
00:09:34,461 --> 00:09:37,021
Now I would like to see
Sapphire. I must verify...

117
00:09:37,061 --> 00:09:39,734
...if the mirror is right, if she is
really more beautiful than me.

118
00:09:39,781 --> 00:09:42,170
Yes, of course, I understand!
Don't worry, Your Highness.

119
00:09:42,221 --> 00:09:44,132
I will call her for you shortly

120
00:09:46,821 --> 00:09:49,938
- What are you waiting for?
- Things are getting interesting

121
00:09:49,981 --> 00:09:51,812
because there is a secret involved
that finally...

122
00:09:52,701 --> 00:09:54,771
...through you
it will be possible to reveal!

123
00:09:56,541 --> 00:09:58,691
Let's get a little practice,
Nylon!

124
00:09:58,741 --> 00:10:01,130
- But you are the thief from yesterday!
- Yeah!

125
00:10:05,341 --> 00:10:06,933
Sapphire?!

126
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:09,415
I can beat you even with this!
Come on!

127
00:10:09,461 --> 00:10:11,417
You know, I'm out of practice!

128
00:10:11,461 --> 00:10:13,099
Come on!

129
00:10:16,421 --> 00:10:18,013
Step forward!

130
00:10:19,661 --> 00:10:21,731
You are as weak as a girl!

131
00:10:26,421 --> 00:10:28,013
Well?

132
00:10:29,821 --> 00:10:31,812
Do you admit your defeat?

133
00:10:31,941 --> 00:10:33,772
Defeat? No...

134
00:10:33,861 --> 00:10:35,499
You say no?

135
00:10:36,661 --> 00:10:39,016
Welcome to my castle,
Princess.

136
00:10:39,061 --> 00:10:42,178
I'm sorry about yesterday.
I am Prince Sapphire.

137
00:10:42,221 --> 00:10:45,452
I must tell you that I have never seen
a girl more beautiful than you.

138
00:10:45,501 --> 00:10:48,732
You are enchanting!
Truly very beautiful!

139
00:10:50,341 --> 00:10:53,014
Thank you, Your Highness.
But are you really a boy?

140
00:10:53,061 --> 00:10:56,019
Why do you doubt it? I have even
admired your beauty!

141
00:10:56,061 --> 00:10:58,495
And soon,
I'll even grow a mustache

142
00:10:59,021 --> 00:11:01,251
Good heavens,
I prefer not to look at you!

143
00:11:01,301 --> 00:11:03,656
Now I believe you.
Indeed, I hope you won't be offended,

144
00:11:03,701 --> 00:11:05,817
if I tell you that I find you
rather ugly.

145
00:11:14,261 --> 00:11:17,253
You teased me by saying
that Sapphire was more beautiful than me.

146
00:11:17,301 --> 00:11:19,531
Now be serious and tell me:
who is the most beautiful?

147
00:11:19,581 --> 00:11:22,095
The answer is that:
Sapphire is the most beautiful.

148
00:11:22,381 --> 00:11:26,010
But Sapphire is a boy! Do you want
to keep teasing me?

149
00:11:26,061 --> 00:11:28,370
What seems to be, is not.
Believe what you wish.

150
00:11:28,541 --> 00:11:30,816
It doesn't seem so at all,
but Sapphire is a maiden.

151
00:11:31,021 --> 00:11:32,534
Go to hell!

152
00:11:35,781 --> 00:11:39,456
We would be honored if you
stayed a little longer in Silverland.

153
00:11:39,501 --> 00:11:42,573
I accept, because I have to
settle a matter close to my heart.

154
00:11:42,621 --> 00:11:44,418
May I know what it is about?

155
00:11:44,461 --> 00:11:47,339
Well, you see... I have to convince
the mirror that I am the most beautiful.

156
00:11:47,501 --> 00:11:51,016
Of course, I understand you!
Then allow me to help you.

157
00:11:51,061 --> 00:11:53,655
...and to offer you
hospitality in my nearby castle.

158
00:11:53,701 --> 00:11:55,419
No, thank you, Baron.

159
00:11:55,461 --> 00:11:59,374
Allow me to take you to the
best inn in the entire realm!

160
00:11:59,421 --> 00:12:02,379
I'd rather not. I prefer to
reside in the palace of the mirror,

161
00:12:02,421 --> 00:12:05,618
...that Chop will build for me.
- I'll build it right away, Your Highness.

162
00:12:06,421 --> 00:12:09,572
But Your Highness, surely you don't
want to have a palace built for you?!

163
00:12:09,661 --> 00:12:12,255
Do you think that I
can stay in an inn?

164
00:12:12,301 --> 00:12:15,020
As soon as it's done, come to
my palace. I will receive you there.

165
00:12:17,101 --> 00:12:19,535
I'm afraid I've given
myself away, Sapphire.

166
00:12:19,581 --> 00:12:22,937
Now be careful, because
Bella might discover your secret.

167
00:12:22,981 --> 00:12:26,212
You know, now you should
behave more manly than usual.

168
00:12:26,261 --> 00:12:29,253
Yeah, but in what way
can I seem more manly?

169
00:12:30,181 --> 00:12:32,615
Let me think a bit
about this problem.

170
00:12:32,661 --> 00:12:35,221
I've got it! You look more
manly when you fight!

171
00:12:35,261 --> 00:12:37,013
When I fight, you say?

172
00:12:41,021 --> 00:12:43,012
Hey, Sapphire! She's coming!

173
00:12:49,021 --> 00:12:52,411
Nothing beats a good
glass of beer with friends!

174
00:13:10,581 --> 00:13:12,651
And now it's your turn!

175
00:13:12,701 --> 00:13:15,169
Come on, you blockheads! Bring it on!

176
00:13:16,661 --> 00:13:18,413
Fight! Bella is watching!

177
00:13:23,461 --> 00:13:27,136
Go get 'em, Sapphire!
Show them your manly spirit!

178
00:13:28,261 --> 00:13:31,776
- That Prince doesn't seem like a girl.
- He doesn't, but...

179
00:13:35,701 --> 00:13:37,817
Maybe it's a pity, so big...

180
00:13:39,501 --> 00:13:41,139
Maybe this one!

181
00:13:41,821 --> 00:13:44,415
Or this one! I changed my mind!

182
00:13:51,781 --> 00:13:54,693
- What a struggle!
- Well done, Sapphire!

183
00:13:56,101 --> 00:13:57,898
Wonderful, Prince Sapphire!

184
00:13:57,941 --> 00:14:00,011
If I had known
that you were watching,

185
00:14:00,061 --> 00:14:02,017
I would have fought
more bravely.

186
00:14:03,341 --> 00:14:05,730
Accept the invitation
to come to my palace.

187
00:14:05,781 --> 00:14:08,534
- I will be very happy to receive you.
- In your palace?!

188
00:14:08,581 --> 00:14:10,731
Yes! It will be called
'Mirror Palace".

189
00:14:10,781 --> 00:14:13,011
Mirror Palace?!
A truly strange name.

190
00:14:13,061 --> 00:14:15,291
But, you know,
it hasn't been built yet.

191
00:14:15,341 --> 00:14:17,218
What? You want to build yourself a palace?

192
00:14:17,261 --> 00:14:20,173
Yes, it will be built in five
minutes. Please, come!

193
00:14:20,221 --> 00:14:22,689
Sounds interesting!
I accept your invitation.

194
00:14:22,741 --> 00:14:25,414
Be careful,
it could be a trap

195
00:14:26,501 --> 00:14:30,016
Excuse me, I remembered that I have to
return to the castle to study.

196
00:14:30,061 --> 00:14:32,017
Don't tell me you study.

197
00:14:32,061 --> 00:14:34,336
Studying is certainly not
for brave people.

198
00:14:34,421 --> 00:14:37,572
Well, then, if you think so,
it means I won't study.

199
00:14:37,621 --> 00:14:40,010
- Then remember that I'm waiting for you.
- Yes.

200
00:14:46,541 --> 00:14:49,499
- I want it to be built here.
- Yes, Princess.

201
00:15:23,341 --> 00:15:25,571
It's already built.
You can enter.

202
00:15:25,621 --> 00:15:27,691
I can't understand
how it was possible.

203
00:15:27,741 --> 00:15:29,697
...to build it so quickly.

204
00:15:30,901 --> 00:15:33,495
Good heavens, a
boy who is afraid!

205
00:15:33,541 --> 00:15:35,497
Really, I'm not afraid!

206
00:15:35,541 --> 00:15:38,009
Wait for me in the
back room, please.

207
00:15:38,061 --> 00:15:39,540
All right!

208
00:15:40,421 --> 00:15:43,777
Now we'll see! If it's a
girl, she will faint from fear.

209
00:15:58,221 --> 00:16:00,018
It's only a mirror.

210
00:16:14,461 --> 00:16:17,931
I found him passed out
in front of the multi-mirror.

211
00:16:20,021 --> 00:16:22,455
Tell the maids to dress Sapphire

212
00:16:22,501 --> 00:16:24,332
..in a woman's dress
and put makeup on him.

213
00:16:24,381 --> 00:16:27,498
As soon as she is ready, I will compare
myself with her to see who is the most beautiful.

214
00:16:27,781 --> 00:16:29,658
It will all be done, Your Highness.

215
00:16:36,501 --> 00:16:38,651
We have finished putting makeup on her!

216
00:16:45,101 --> 00:16:48,093
How beautiful! I am shocked!
She is indeed very beautiful!

217
00:16:54,461 --> 00:16:56,816
Mirror, my mirror,
tell me once again:

218
00:16:56,861 --> 00:16:58,897
who is more beautiful? Sapphire or I?

219
00:16:58,941 --> 00:17:01,899
Satisfaction is not granted to you,
the answer is ever the same.

220
00:17:02,021 --> 00:17:04,489
Even if over seas and mountains
you have traveled satisfied,

221
00:17:04,541 --> 00:17:07,214
the illusion that your supremacy
over the world does not fade..

222
00:17:07,261 --> 00:17:09,900
...gives way to despair
for a dream that is now dead.

223
00:17:09,941 --> 00:17:12,694
Of the realm, the most beautiful
is Sapphire, always her.

224
00:17:18,381 --> 00:17:20,849
- My loyal servant..
- Yes, Your Highness?

225
00:17:21,341 --> 00:17:24,697
- Sapphire must no longer live.
- As you wish, Your Highness.

226
00:17:24,901 --> 00:17:27,699
Anyone who is more beautiful than me
must be punished.

227
00:17:27,741 --> 00:17:29,299
It shall be done.

228
00:17:37,741 --> 00:17:39,413
Wait!

229
00:17:39,861 --> 00:17:42,694
I order you to kill Sapphire
at all costs!

230
00:17:47,861 --> 00:17:49,613
Away, Opal!

231
00:17:58,541 --> 00:18:00,816
First let's test this weapon.

232
00:18:04,901 --> 00:18:06,619
Perfect!

233
00:18:11,701 --> 00:18:13,259
And now...

234
00:18:41,701 --> 00:18:43,419
I must hurry!

235
00:18:56,821 --> 00:18:58,891
This time you won't escape me!

236
00:19:09,221 --> 00:19:11,894
There it is!
That mirror on the wall..!

237
00:19:28,501 --> 00:19:30,492
It's over for you!

238
00:19:32,741 --> 00:19:35,175
I will turn this weapon
against them!

239
00:19:36,901 --> 00:19:38,619
Now we shall see!

240
00:19:47,741 --> 00:19:50,301
What?! The palace is collapsing!

241
00:19:51,261 --> 00:19:54,094
Bella, run away!
Run away, Princess!

242
00:19:54,141 --> 00:19:57,338
The palace will collapse on you!
Princess!

243
00:19:58,381 --> 00:20:00,258
Let me out!

244
00:20:01,341 --> 00:20:03,616
Let me out of this cage!

245
00:20:05,021 --> 00:20:08,218
We are in danger!
Let me out of here!

246
00:20:08,301 --> 00:20:12,340
Princess! There is not a minute
to lose! Let me out!

247
00:20:12,381 --> 00:20:14,690
I know you are not
capable of killing!

248
00:20:14,741 --> 00:20:16,732
You don't really want me to die?!

249
00:20:16,781 --> 00:20:18,578
I won't be the one to kill you,

250
00:20:18,621 --> 00:20:21,294
but you will die buried
under the rubble of this palace!

251
00:20:21,341 --> 00:20:23,332
And then, finally,
I will be the most beautiful,

252
00:20:23,381 --> 00:20:25,497
of this kingdom
and of the whole world!

253
00:20:25,901 --> 00:20:27,653
Come on, mirror!

254
00:20:31,901 --> 00:20:34,256
My magic mirror
is collapsing!

255
00:20:36,821 --> 00:20:39,699
My duty as a mirror
is over. I was already old.

256
00:20:39,821 --> 00:20:42,540
Now that you are no longer the first,
you, of my rhyming verdicts...

257
00:20:42,581 --> 00:20:45,379
...will no longer hear my voice
to know who is the fairest.

258
00:20:45,421 --> 00:20:48,413
Satisfied, I retire
and give the palm to Sapphire.

259
00:20:53,781 --> 00:20:56,898
- Bella!
- I must flee!

260
00:20:57,501 --> 00:21:00,459
Bella, let me out!
Please! Bella!

261
00:21:09,581 --> 00:21:11,731
Save me, Bella! Help me!

262
00:21:19,581 --> 00:21:23,210
Now I want to show you again
what you are going to become.

263
00:21:36,741 --> 00:21:39,016
Oh, no! It is not possible!

264
00:21:39,061 --> 00:21:41,177
Once your springtime fades,

265
00:21:41,221 --> 00:21:44,179
you will take on your true appearance
and this is how you will become,

266
00:21:44,501 --> 00:21:48,858
because indeed within you there is ugliness.
Only on the outside is there beauty.

267
00:21:49,181 --> 00:21:51,741
This identity of yours,
if you do not change, will prevail.

268
00:21:52,101 --> 00:21:54,820
But I want to suggest to you
a remedy, to finish:

269
00:21:55,101 --> 00:21:59,219
if you change your heart inside
and show a little love,

270
00:21:59,261 --> 00:22:03,015
you will return serene and beautiful
and Sapphire, just as she was,

271
00:22:03,261 --> 00:22:05,217
she will become your great friend.

272
00:22:05,501 --> 00:22:08,493
This is, more than words can say,
the beauty of life.

273
00:22:08,781 --> 00:22:12,740
I have finished.
Goodbye, Your Highness.

274
00:22:23,061 --> 00:22:25,017
Bella, be careful!

275
00:22:27,541 --> 00:22:29,577
- Come, quickly!
- Just in time!

276
00:22:38,701 --> 00:22:40,692
Goodbye, Bella.

277
00:22:43,021 --> 00:22:46,172
- Well, Sapphire, I...
- Don't say anything. I understand.

278
00:22:56,901 --> 00:22:59,335
Goodbye!
You are still the most beautiful

279
00:22:59,381 --> 00:23:02,020
I don't care. I have understood
what true beauty is.

280
00:23:02,061 --> 00:23:05,178
This gift will make you
remember my friendship.

281
00:23:06,021 --> 00:23:08,012
How dear you are, Sapphire!

282
00:23:08,061 --> 00:23:09,892
Goodbye, Your Highness!

283
00:23:10,101 --> 00:23:11,454
Let's go!

284
00:23:41,261 --> 00:23:43,252
- Goodbye!
- Goodbye!

285
